{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1767173,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"indigo-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"MindTech Arena 2026 \u2013 National Hackathon","festival_id":null,"organization_id":141077,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-07T12:00:15+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-11T05:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/mindtech-arena-2026-national-hackathon-iiit-kottayam-1767173","region":"offline","details":"<p>MindTech Arena 2026 is a national-level student competition organized by the <strong>MindQuest Club of IIIT Kottayam<\/strong> as a flagship event under <strong>Aaroh 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/GGT8zYw8whZ51JSecgQ98x?mode=gi_t\">click here to join the whatsapp group for event updates<\/a><\/p>\n<p>The event brings together <strong>technology, logical thinking, creativity, problem-solving and teamwork<\/strong> through three engaging rounds. Designed to be beginner-friendly while still challenging participants, MindTech Arena gives students an opportunity to test their technical fundamentals, develop innovative solutions and present their ideas before a panel of judges.<\/p>\n<p>From quick-thinking challenges to solution building and final presentations, every round is designed to test a different aspect of a participant's ability to <strong>think, collaborate and innovate<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Beginners are encouraged to participate.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants from different colleges can form a team.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Students from different branches, specializations or disciplines can form a team.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Mixed-year teams are allowed.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>There is no compulsory senior&ndash;fresher combination.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Size<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each team can have <strong>1&ndash;5 members<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Participants may register individually or as a team.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Inter-college teams are allowed.<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Inter-specialization and interdisciplinary teams are allowed.<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Each participant can be part of only <strong>one team<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Participation &amp; Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Mode:<\/strong> Offline<\/li>\n<li><strong>Venue:<\/strong> Indian Institute of Information Technology (IIIT) Kottayam<\/li>\n<li><strong>Team Size:<\/strong> 1&ndash;5 Members<\/li>\n<li><strong>Organizer:<\/strong> MindQuest Club, IIIT Kottayam<\/li>\n<li><strong>Flagship Event:<\/strong> Aaroh 2026.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compete with students from different institutions.<\/li>\n<li>Test your technical fundamentals and logical thinking.<\/li>\n<li>Develop creative solutions to real-world problems.<\/li>\n<li>Improve teamwork and communication.<\/li>\n<li>Experience a multi-round competitive environment.<\/li>\n<li>Showcase your ideas before judges.<\/li>\n<li>Win cash prizes and earn recognition.<\/li>\n<li>Receive participation certification.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Participation Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each participant may register with only one team.<\/li>\n<li>All participant and team information must be accurate.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must report to the venue according to the schedule communicated by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must follow the instructions provided before each round.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must complete each round within the specified time.<\/li>\n<li>Only resources and tools permitted by the organizers may be used during the respective rounds.<\/li>\n<li>Event credits are exclusively part of the competition mechanism and do not represent academic or activity credits.<\/li>\n<li>Participants are expected to maintain professional and respectful conduct throughout the event.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each participant can be part of only one registered team.<\/li>\n<li>A team must have a minimum of 1 and maximum of 5 members.<\/li>\n<li>Inter-college and inter-specialization teams are permitted.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must provide genuine and accurate information during registration.<\/li>\n<li>Any form of cheating, impersonation, plagiarism or unfair assistance may result in immediate disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must follow all round-specific instructions and time limits.<\/li>\n<li>Teams must not interfere with the event systems, judging process or participation of other teams.<\/li>\n<li>Any external resources or tools used during a round must comply with the rules announced by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to disqualify teams that violate the event rules.<\/li>\n<li>The decision of the judges regarding qualification, evaluation and winners will be final.<\/li>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to make reasonable changes to the event schedule or format. Any significant changes will be communicated to participants.<\/li>\n<li>By participating in MindTech Arena 2026, all participants agree to abide by the rules and guidelines of the event.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33549201,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-07T13:20:24+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-08T12:12:25+05:30","communication_sent":1,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"XLgGIFJ","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":11,"referral_le